15:37.440 --> 15:37.700
à la chair,

15:37.780 --> 15:38.300
selon la chair.

15:39.700 --> 15:39.980
Et donc,

15:40.020 --> 15:40.480
Paul va dire

15:40.480 --> 15:41.060
loin de moi

15:41.060 --> 15:41.480
la pensée

15:41.480 --> 15:42.060
de me glorifier

15:42.060 --> 15:42.800
d'autres choses

15:42.800 --> 15:44.600
